      "content": "Focus on using AI for augmentation rather than outright replacement to maintain morale. Implement AI tools for repetitive, low-value tasks like data entry or scheduling, allowing your team members to focus on higher-impact, creative work. Clearly communicate that AI is a support tool designed to eliminate tedious tasks, not a measure of job security. This strategic integration can significantly cut overhead while positively reshaping your workforce experience.",
